# SoundPlant demo: house_acid, 124 BPM, E phrygian. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# Hot, squelchy, playful acid house in E Phrygian, 112 bars. A 16-bar 303 solo opens the song, its cutoff and resonance
# ramping open and shut on locks. Then bellows organ stabs on the rave offbeats (Em and F, the flat second is the colour),
# a vocal-chop chant that calls and answers, a half-time jack (the kit at eighths, the 303 and the chant at double speed),
# a breakdown on Fmaj7 and E with the chant alone, a build, two peaks and a final where the 303 solo returns over everything.
# T1 909 kit  T2 acid squelch (the 303)  T3 bellows organ stab  T4 voile vocal chop (the call)  T5 jacquard octave pad (drone)
# T6 acid lead (the second line)  T7 rayon toy keys (ear candy)  T8 voile vocal chop (the answer)
# Song: solo 16, rave 8, chant 8, jack 8, rave2 8, break 12, build 4, peak 8, peak2 8, final 20, outro 12.
bpm 124
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 4
knob 9 e3 5

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the 909: a punchy kick tuned near E1, a clap, hats, an open hat on the offbeats, a dry shaker, a conga
knob 1 d1.model 21
knob 1 d1.k1 0
knob 1 d1.k2 50
knob 1 d1.k3 34
knob 1 d1.k4 40
knob 1 d1.k5 41
knob 1 d1.k6 44
knob 1 d1.k7 0
knob 1 d1.volume 72
knob 1 d2.model 22
knob 1 d2.k2 40
knob 1 d2.k3 70
knob 1 d2.volume 64
knob 1 d2.send2 20
knob 1 d3.volume 72
knob 1 d4.model 27
knob 1 d4.k1 64
knob 1 d4.k2 62
knob 1 d4.volume 92
knob 1 d5.model 25
knob 1 d5.k1 63
knob 1 d5.k2 50
knob 1 d5.k3 30
knob 1 d5.k4 0
knob 1 d5.volume 72
knob 1 d5.send2 24
knob 1 d6.model 23
knob 1 d6.volume 62
knob 1 d7.model 23
knob 1 d7.k1 80
knob 1 d7.volume 58
knob 1 d8.model 7
knob 1 d8.volume 50
knob 1 d9.k1 50
knob 1 d9.k4 0
knob 1 d9.volume 78
knob 1 level 60
# T2 acid squelch: the 303, ducked by the kick, resonant, the cutoff and resonance move with locks
preset 2 squelch acid
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain no
knob 2 volume 127
knob 2 ltype pump
knob 2 lspeed track_1
knob 2 lamt 40
knob 2 level 78
knob 2 r 36
knob 2 send1 22
knob 2 send2 12
# T3 bellows organ stab: the rave chord on the offbeats, into the echo
preset 3 organ_stab bellows
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain no
knob 3 level 120
knob 3 r 34
knob 3 pan 34
knob 3 send1 46
knob 3 send2 28
# T4 voile vocal chop: the call of the chant, left of centre, in the echo and the room
preset 4 vocal_chop voile
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 brain no
knob 4 level 127
knob 4 volume 127
knob 4 cut 127
knob 4 pan 40
knob 4 send1 36
knob 4 send2 34
# T5 jacquard octave pad: the drone of the breakdown and the build, the low E that carries the final, the held E under the end
preset 5 octave_pad jacquard
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 brain no
knob 5 level 116
knob 5 volume 127
knob 5 r 64
knob 5 pan 56
knob 5 send2 52
# T6 acid lead: the second 303, an octave up and right, a squelchy counter line
preset 6 acid_lead acid
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain no
knob 6 volume 127
knob 6 ltype pump
knob 6 lspeed track_1
knob 6 lamt 40
knob 6 level 116
knob 6 r 40
knob 6 pan 84
knob 6 send1 30
# T7 rayon toy keys: ear candy, blips and arpeggios in the echo and the hall
preset 7 toy_keys rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain no
knob 7 level 116
knob 7 volume 118
knob 7 r 44
knob 7 pan 28
knob 7 send1 44
knob 7 send2 40
# T8 voile vocal chop: the answer of the chant, right of centre
preset 8 vocal_chop voile
param 8 oct 2
knob 8 brain no
knob 8 level 127
knob 8 volume 127
knob 8 cut 127
knob 8 pan 92
knob 8 send1 30
knob 8 send2 30
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo, FX II a long hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 108
knob 11 e3 58
knob 11 e4 46
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 82
knob 12 e3 56
mst lo 58
mst hi 66
mst comp 52
mst pump 28
mst pumpby kick
mst release 70
mst level 106
groove swing

